{"title": "Knockdown Jaws", "pageid": 16544, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Knockdown_Jaws", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Knockdown Jaws</b> is a passive feature that allows the user's bite attacks to knock targets Prone.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Bite attacks from this creature can possibly knock the target <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Doggy\" title=\"Doggy\">Doggy</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mastiff\" title=\"Shadow Mastiff\">Shadow Mastiff</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow_Mastiff_Alpha\" title=\"Shadow Mastiff Alpha\">Shadow Mastiff Alpha</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715054952\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.029 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.034 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 706/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3183/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1516/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 286/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643708/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.109      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   31.109      1 -total\n 41.55%   12.927      1 Template:Cond\n 29.08%    9.047      1 Template:Condition_inline/format\n 27.96%    8.698      1 Template:Icon_link\n 26.91%    8.370      1 Template:Icon_text\n 23.53%    7.320      2 Template:Trim\n 20.63%    6.419      1 Template:Ifempty\n 13.00%    4.045      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 12.22%    3.803      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:16544-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715054952 and revision id 168389. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}